    # a tuple grid keeps the launch off the ~200 ms JITFunction.run path.
    # BLOCK=256 / num_warps=4 keeps 64 elements per warp: the loop-carried
    # chains miscompile (silently) at >64 elements per warp or BLOCK > 256.
